Package: quiver
Title: Install Agent Skills From Any Source
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Athanasia Monika", "Mowinckel", , "a.m.mowinckel@psykologi.uio.no", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A source- and agent-agnostic engine for installing Agent
    Skills (<https://www.anthropic.com/news/skills>) into a project or
    user profile. Skills can be resolved from a local directory, a
    'GitHub' repository, or a curated registry, and installed for any
    agent adapter, at project or user scope, with checksum-based
    protection against clobbering hand edits.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/drmowinckels/quiver
